    {
      "id": "en.n3.class-93.t03",
      "en": "Tom says, \"I disagree, because I worry that the garden will be noisy.\"",
      "es": "Tom dice: «No estoy de acuerdo, porque me preocupa que el jardín sea ruidoso.»",
      "explanationEs": "I disagree: no estoy de acuerdo. Worry that + oración: lo que preocupa.",
      "segments": [
        "Tom says, \"I disagree, because I worry",
        "that the garden will be noisy.\""
      ],
      "audioText": "Tom says, \"I disagree, because I worry that the garden will be noisy.\"",
